          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Whenever we use the word height of the triangle, we generally refer to the length of the altitude to whatever side we take as base (this altitude is AD in the case of Fig. 7.8)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
